# AI Alchemist — Current Positioning

## Core Identity

AI Alchemist is a public learning and education brand focused on helping beginners — especially women 40+ — become confident using AI through practical experimentation, building, and real-world workflows.

The brand documents a real journey of learning AI publicly through:
- building projects
- experimenting with tools
- solving workplace problems
- creating systems
- teaching others along the way

This is not a “fake guru” AI brand.

The mission is to make AI feel:
- approachable
- practical
- creative
- empowering
- safe to learn

---

# Brand Mission

Help overwhelmed or intimidated beginners move from fear and confusion to confidence and capability with AI.

Especially:
- women 40+
- non-technical professionals
- managers
- curious beginners
- people who feel left behind by technology

